  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Which expression is equivalent to <math alttext=\"16 x cubed y squared plus 14 x y\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>16</mn>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>3</mn>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>14</mn>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>?</p>",
  "answerOptions": [
    {
      "id": "a5dd8691-7ed3-4296-b747-c0551479391d",
      "content": "<p><math alttext=\"2 x y left parenthesis 8 x y plus 7 right parenthesis\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t<mfenced>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t\t<mn>8</mn>\n\t\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t\t<mn>7</mn>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t</mfenced>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"
