  "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is correct. Since <math alttext=\"2 x y\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t<mi>y</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math> is a common factor of each term in the given expression, the expression can be rewritten as&nbsp;<math alttext=\"2 x y left parenthesis 8 x squared y plus 7 right parenthesis\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This expression is equivalent to&nbsp;<math alttext=\"16 x squared y squared plus 14 x y\"><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. This expression is equivalent to&nbsp;<math alttext=\"28 x cubed y squared plus 14 x y\"><mn>28</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect. This expression is equivalent to&nbsp;<math alttext=\"112 x cubed y squared plus 14 x y\"><mn>112</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></math>.</p>",
